    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 2 studies in children: lymph node specimens with a composite reference standard. Sensitivity is 0.80 (Aurilio 2022) and 0.50 (Zar 2018-2023); specificity is not estimable in one and 1.00 in the other.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
